msgid "Receive vendor bills"
msgstr "Lieferantenrechnung erhalten"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:176
msgid ""
"New documents received via Peppol are checked multiple times a day. "
"Depending on the :ref:`registration settings <accounting/e-invoicing/peppol-"
"registration>`, received documents are automatically:"
msgstr ""
"Neue Dokumente, die über Peppol eingehen, werden mehrmals täglich überprüft. "
"Abhängig von den :ref:`Registrierungseinstellungen <accounting/e-invoicing/"
"peppol-registration>` werden eingegangene Dokumente automatisch:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:180
msgid ""
"either imported into the purchase journal set in the :guilabel:`PEPPOL "
"Electronic Invoicing` section, and corresponding vendor bills are created as "
"drafts;"
msgstr ""
"entweder in das im Abschnitt :guilabel:`PEPPOL für elektronische "
"Rechnungsstellung` festgelegte Einkaufsjournal importiert und entsprechende "
"Lieferantenrechnungen als Entwürfe erstellt;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:182
msgid ""
"or received via the :ref:`Documents app <accounting/e-invoicing/receive-"
"vendor-bills-documents-app>`."
msgstr ""
"oder über die :ref:`Dokumente-App <accounting/e-invoicing/receive-vendor-"
"bills-documents-app>` empfangen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:186
msgid ""
"To manually trigger the scheduled action used to retrieve incoming Peppol "
"documents, enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, open the Settings "
"app, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Scheduled actions`, "
"and search for :guilabel:`Peppol: retrieve new documents`. Open the "
"scheduled action, then click :guilabel:`Run Manually`."
msgstr ""
"Um die geplante Aktion zum Abrufen eingehender Peppol-Dokumente manuell "
"auszulösen, aktivieren Sie den :ref:`Entwicklermodus <developer-mode>`, "
"öffnen Sie die Einstellungen-App, gehen Sie zu :menuselection:`Einstellungen "
"--> Technisch --> Geplante Aktionen` und suchen Sie nach :guilabel:`Peppol: "
"neue Dokumente abrufen`. Öffnen Sie die geplante Aktion und klicken Sie dann "
"auf :guilabel:`Manuell ausführen`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:194
msgid "Vendor bills reception in Documents"
msgstr "Empfang von Lieferantenrechnungen in Dokumente"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:197
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Documents - Import from Peppol` "
"(`documents_account_peppol`) module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass das Modul :guilabel:`Dokumente – Import über "
"Peppol` (documents_account_peppol) :ref:`installiert <general/install>` ist."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:200
msgid ""
