msgid ""
"Download the mandatory `certificate of conformity <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"contract/french-certification/>`_ delivered by Odoo SA."
msgstr ""
"Laden Sie das obligatorische `Konformitätszertifikat <https://www.odoo.com/"
"my/contract/french-certification/>`_ herunter, das von Odoo SA ausgestellt "
"wird."

