#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:161
msgid ""
"Once an invoice is confirmed, click the :guilabel:`Send` button to open the "
"wizard. Select :guilabel:`E-Invoicing`, then click the :guilabel:`Generate` "
"button. Odoo will upload the JSON-signed file of the invoice to the NIC e-"
