msgstr ""
"Die Felder :guilabel:`Land` und :guilabel:`Steuer-ID` "
"im :doc:`Firmendatensatz <../../general/companies>` sind ausgefüllt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:295
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Spain -TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) module is :ref:`installed "
"<general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Das Modul :guilabel:`Spanien - TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) "
